OL,3,GNEWSASocial poker with #5 stake is
OL,4,Abooming, says dealer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who organises social poker
OL,7,Fsessions in pubs and clubs said the
OL,8,Fgame's growing popularity could be down
OL,9,Fto the cost-of-living crisis.
OL,11,FPhillip Steer, from March,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire, has run poker nights in
OL,13,FFenland for 14 years and said he has
OL,14,Fseen a 35% rise in the number of
OL,15,Fplayers in the area since 2022, with
OL,16,Fnow about "100 players across 15 clubs
OL,17,Fand pubs".
OL,19,FSteer added that as people can only
OL,20,Fplace a maximum #5 stake, the game was
OL,21,Foften "cheaper" than other pastimes.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
